Description: Provides an end-to-end workflow for NASA Global Ecosystem
  Dynamics Investigation (GEDI) Level 1B, Level 2A, Level 2B, Level 3, Level
  4A, and Level 4B data. Functions search NASA catalogues, download granules,
  stream HDF5 products from Earthdata Cloud, and extract geolocations,
  waveforms, elevation and relative-height metrics, canopy cover, plant area
  profiles, and aboveground biomass. Methods quality-filter and spatially clip
  HDF5, tabular, and raster products; calculate footprint and polygon
  statistics; create gridded summaries; and visualize orbital tracks and
  measurements. The package also simulates GEDI-like waveforms from airborne
  laser-scanning point clouds and supports spatial sampling, predictive
  modelling, ancillary-data extraction, and wall-to-wall upscaling with
  optional Google Earth Engine workflows.
